 VIN, upstream of the shunts." (at 20.32 170.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0a293e63-b3e1-5e3e-8b67-d19943311863")) (text "VIN 1.8 V to 5.5 V (U3 supply and FET Vgs). 3V3 for INA228 + MCU comes from the host header J3. Program U2 over SWD (J4)." (at 20.32 175.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2e2a5439-5581-5bf5-8317-81f65bab1d63")) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))